# Fruit of the Mothertree (Q161): an elven fighter of level 10 accepts at Andellia with her
# letter, Thalia takes it for the Mother Tree's fruit, and Andellia takes the fruit for adena and
# experience; then relog. Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
